1
00:05:15,555 --> 00:05:21,555
Return to the magic.

2
00:10:31,111 --> 00:10:37,111
Fantastic Beasts: The Secrets of Dumbledore is a fantasy,
adventure film directed by David Yates.

3
00:15:46,666 --> 00:15:52,666
Professor Albus Dumbledore knows the powerful, dark wizard Gellert
Grindelwald is moving to seize control of the wizarding world.

4
00:21:02,222 --> 00:21:08,222
Unable to stop him alone, he entrusts magizoologist Newt Scamander
to lead an intrepid team of wizards and witches.

5
00:26:17,777 --> 00:26:23,777
They soon encounter an array of old and new beasts as they clash
with Grindelwald's growing legion of followers.

6
00:31:33,333 --> 00:31:39,333
Newt Scamander, played by Eddie Redmayne.

7
00:36:48,888 --> 00:36:54,888
Albus Dumbledore, played by Jude Law.

8
00:42:04,444 --> 00:42:10,444
Gellert Grindelwald, played by Mads Mikkelsen.

9
00:47:20,000 --> 00:47:26,000
Credence Barebone / Aurelius Dumbledore, played by Ezra Miller.

10
00:52:35,555 --> 00:52:41,555
Jacob Kowalski, played by Dan Fogler.

11
00:57:51,111 --> 00:57:57,111
Queenie Goldstein, played by Alison Sudol.

12
01:03:06,666 --> 01:03:12,666
Fantastic Beasts: The Secrets of Dumbledore is a 2022 fantasy film
directed by David Yates from an screenplay by J.

13
01:08:22,222 --> 01:08:28,222
Rowling and Steve Kloves, based on characters by Rowling.

14
01:13:37,777 --> 01:13:43,777
The sequel to Fantastic Beasts: The Crimes of Grindelwald (2018), it is the third and final instalment in
the Fantastic Beasts film series and the eleventh overall in the Wizarding World franchise.

15
01:18:53,333 --> 01:18:59,333
The film features an ensemble cast that includes Eddie Redmayne, Jude Law, Ezra Miller, Dan Fogler,
Alison Sudol, Callum Turner, Jessica Williams, Katherine Waterston, and Mads Mikkelsen.

16
01:24:08,888 --> 01:24:14,888
Set five years after the events of its predecessor, the film sees Albus Dumbledore tasking Newt Scamander and his
allies with a mission that takes them into the heart of dark wizard Gellert Grindelwald's army.

17
01:29:24,444 --> 01:29:30,444
The film was slated for release in November 2021, before it was
pushed back to April 2022 due to the COVID-19 epidemic.

18
01:34:40,000 --> 01:34:46,000
Much of the main cast from the first two films
confirmed their involvement in March 2020.

19
01:39:55,555 --> 01:40:01,555
Principal photography was set to begin in early 2020, but was postponed due
to the epidemic, eventually commencing in September 2020.

20
01:45:11,111 --> 01:45:17,111
Johnny Depp returned as Grindelwald and filmed one scene for this film, but was asked to step down in November 2020 following
the verdict of the Depp v News Group Newspapers Ltd court case; Mads Mikkelson replaced him later that month.

21
01:50:26,666 --> 01:50:32,666
Filming took place until February 2021.

22
01:55:42,222 --> 01:55:48,222
Fantastic Beasts: The Secrets of Dumbledore premiered at the Royal Festival Hall in London on March 29 2022, and was
released internationally on April 14, 2022; and in the United States on April 15, by Warner Bros.

23
02:00:57,777 --> 02:01:03,777
The film received mixed reviews from critics and grossed over $407 million worldwide,
making it the lowest-grossing film in the Wizarding World franchise.

24
02:06:13,333 --> 02:06:19,333
The Secrets of Dumbledore was the last film in the Wizarding World franchise for which
Stuart Craig served as production designer, before his death in 2025.

25
02:11:28,888 --> 02:11:34,888
The film explores themes of prison, witch, berlin,
germany, magic, election campaign.

26
02:16:44,444 --> 02:16:50,444
The tone is dark and emotional.
